### RBAC ve Durum Makinesi Test Senaryoları
### REST Client (VS Code) veya HTTPie ile kullanılabilir

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@waiterToken = YOUR_WAITER_TOKEN_HERE
@kitchenToken = YOUR_KITCHEN_TOKEN_HERE

### ============================================
### Senaryo A: Garson Sipariş → Send → Kitchen Start → Ready → Waiter Served → Payment Paid
### ============================================

### 1. Garson: Sipariş Oluştur
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/waiter/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tableNumber": "5",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PRODUCT_ID_1",
      "qty": 2,
      "note": "Az baharatlı"
    },
    {
      "productId": "PRODUCT_ID_2",
      "qty": 1,
      "note": ""
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Masa 5 siparişi"
}

### 2. Garson: Siparişi Mutfağa Gönder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/waiter/orders/{{orderId}}/send
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### 3. Mutfak: İlk Item'ı Hazırlamaya Başla
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kitchen/items/{{itemId1}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{kitchenToken}}

### 4. Mutfak: İlk Item'ı Hazır Olarak İşaretle
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kitchen/items/{{itemId1}}/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{kitchenToken}}

### 5. Mutfak: İkinci Item'ı Hazırlamaya Başla
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kitchen/items/{{itemId2}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{kitchenToken}}

### 6. Mutfak: İkinci Item'ı Hazır Olarak İşaretle
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kitchen/items/{{itemId2}}/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{kitchenToken}}

### 7. Garson: İlk Item'ı Servis Edildi Olarak İşaretle
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/waiter/items/{{itemId1}}/served
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### 8. Garson: İkinci Item'ı Servis Edildi Olarak İşaretle
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/waiter/items/{{itemId2}}/served
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### 9. Garson: Ödeme Yap
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "method": "cash",
  "amount": 150.00
}

### ============================================
### Senaryo B: İptal Akışı
### ============================================

### 1. Garson: Sipariş Oluştur
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/waiter/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tableNumber": "3",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PRODUCT_ID_1",
      "qty": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Admin: Siparişi İptal Et (CREATED durumunda)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Müşteri iptal etti"
}

### 3. Admin: Ödenmiş Siparişi İptal Etmeye Çalış (HATA BEKLENİYOR)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders/{{paidOrderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Test"
}

### ============================================
### Senaryo C: Metriklerin Artışı
### ============================================

### 1. Admin: Bugünün İstatistiklerini Al
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stats/today
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. Garson: Sipariş Oluştur ve Öde
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/waiter/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tableNumber": "10",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PRODUCT_ID_1",
      "qty": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 3. Garson: Mutfağa Gönder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/waiter/orders/{{orderId}}/send
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### 4. Mutfak: Hazırla ve Hazır İşaretle
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kitchen/items/{{itemId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{kitchenToken}}

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/kitchen/items/{{itemId}}/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{kitchenToken}}

### 5. Garson: Servis Et
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/waiter/items/{{itemId}}/served
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}

### 6. Garson: Ödeme Yap
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{waiterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "method": "card",
  "amount": 75.00
}

### 7. Admin: İstatistikleri Tekrar Al (revenue ve orders artmış olmalı)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stats/today
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================
### Ek Testler
### ============================================

### Mutfak: Kuyruk Listesi (Tüm Station'lar)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/kitchen/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{kitchenToken}}

### Mutfak: Kuyruk Listesi (Sadece Hot Station)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/kitchen/queue?station=hot
Authorization: Bearer {{kitchenToken}}

### Admin: Günlük Rapor (CSV)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/daily?from=2024-01-01&to=2024-01-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: Sipariş Listesi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: Ürün Listesi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: Kategori Listesi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}















